          <Pad Id="BM06S1IEJEv9WJQNUpH1nr" Bounds="580,250,320,80" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt; Z has no unit and no meaning of its own - metres, floors or a model axis, nothing here knows. M, the fourth ordinate, is not exposed.">
